.so fork.tmac
.PP
.pt_jd_destroy
.RS 4
.PP
This function safely frees the memory tree, including the
.B jd_Node
instance that is passed to the function.
.TP
.I node
recursively frees the siblings of
.IR node ,
then the children.
When all relatives of
.I node
have been freed, the
.I node
itself will be freed and the pointer to
.I node
will be set to
.BR NULL.
.RE
